- **Storybook `title`**: `Atoms/Tooltip`

### `Overlay` — `src/components/Overlay/`
- **Figma**: "Overlay" — full-viewport semi-transparent scrim used behind modals, fly-out panels, and other focus-stealing UI
- **Props**: `modelValue?: boolean` (v-model), `lockScroll?: boolean` (default `true`), `dismissOnClick?: boolean` (default `true`), `dismissOnEsc?: boolean` (default `true`), `zIndex?: number` (default `900`)
- **Emits**: `update:modelValue: [value: boolean]`, `click: [event: MouseEvent]`
- **Slots**: default — content rendered on top of the scrim
- **Behaviour**: Teleports to `<body>`; click on scrim emits close; ESC key emits close; body scroll lock when visible
- **Visual**: `position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(36, 44, 51, 0.5)` — Neutral0 at 50% opacity; `z-index` via prop (default 900)
- **Transition**: 200ms opacity fade in/out
- **Usage**: **Default overlay for the entire design system.** `BaseModal` composes this component internally.
- **Stories**: Default (Interactive), ModalContext, FlyOutContext
- **Storybook `title`**: `Atoms/Overlay`

### `SonicCircuitBenefit` — `src/components/SonicCircuitBenefit/`
- **Figma**: derived from the per-tile pattern inside "The Sonic Circuit" frame (desktop node `7680:16688`, mobile `7680:16721`).
- **Role**: Atomic icon-on-circle + caption tile. Building block for the `SonicCircuit` organism — not used standalone on the page. Renders as a `<li>` so the parent `<ul role="list">` carries proper benefits-list semantics.
- **Props**: `caption: string` (**required** — body text rendered below the disk), `iconSvg: string` (**required** — raw SVG markup for the icon; import the source SVG with `?raw`).
- **No slots**: The icon is a prop, not a slot, so `v-html` runs **inside** the atom on `.scb__icon` itself.
- **Icon tint**: The atom rewrites every `path / circle / rect / polygon / polyline / ellipse` fill to `currentColor` and sets `.scb__icon { color: #D0D4D9 }`.
- **Layout**: `flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px; width: 284px` on desktop; `width: 100%` on mobile.
- **Disk**: 102 × 102 px (desktop) / 64 × 64 px (mobile) circle with `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15)`.
- **Inner art**: `width: 78 / 49 px` on desktop / mobile.
- **Caption**: 16 / 22 / -0.5 px Roboto Regular, white, centered.
- **Stories**: `MapPin`, `Coin`, `Steering`, `Medal`, `Mobile`
- **Storybook `title`**: `Atoms/SonicCircuitBenefit`
